graph TB
    %% 多智能体协同系统架构 - Mermaid格式

    Input[用户请求] --> Router

    subgraph MultiAgent["多智能体协同系统 (MultiAgentSystem)"]
        Router[请求路由器<br/>Request Router]
        Workflow[工作流引擎<br/>StateGraph Workflow]
        Planner[执行计划构建器]

        subgraph Coaches["教练智能体池"]
            Planning[训练规划教练<br/>Planning Coach]
            Technique[技术指导教练<br/>Technique Coach]
            Recovery[运动康复教练<br/>Recovery Coach]

            Planning -- 计划制定 --> P1[周期化安排]
            Planning -- 目标导向 --> P2[目标导向规划]

            Technique -- 动作指导 --> T1[姿势分析]
            Technique -- 技术修正 --> T2[技术反馈]

            Recovery -- 损伤预防 --> R1[风险评估]
            Recovery -- 恢复建议 --> R2[康复方案]
        end

        Synthesizer[综合输出器<br/>Synthesizer]
    end

    subgraph External["外部服务"]
        LLM[大语言模型<br/>通义千问]
        RAG[高级检索器<br/>RAG]
        Memory[记忆服务<br/>MemoryService]
    end

    Output[综合响应] --> OutputResult

    %% 流程连接
    Router -->|路由结果| Workflow
    Workflow -->|构建执行计划| Planner
    Planner -->|批次执行| Planning
    Planner -->|批次执行| Technique
    Planner -->|批次执行| Recovery

    Planning -->|规划结果| Workflow
    Technique -->|技术建议| Workflow
    Recovery -->|康复建议| Workflow

    Workflow -->|汇总结果| Synthesizer
    Synthesizer --> Output

    %% 外部服务连接
    Router -->|获取用户画像| Memory
    Workflow -->|更新记忆| Memory
    Workflow -->|检索相关知识| RAG

    Planning -->|调用LLM| LLM
    Technique -->|调用LLM| LLM
    Recovery -->|调用LLM| LLM
    Synthesizer -->|调用LLM| LLM
    Router -->|问题分类| LLM

    %% 样式
    classDef inputStyle fill:#fff2cc,stroke:#d6b656,stroke-width:2px
    classDef routerStyle fill:#dae8fc,stroke:#6c8ebf,stroke-width:2px
    classDef workflowStyle fill:#d5e8d4,stroke:#82b366,stroke-width:2px
    classDef planningStyle fill:#e1d5e7,stroke:#9673a6,stroke-width:2px
    classDef coachStyle fill:#ffe6cc,stroke:#d79b00,stroke-width:2px
    classDef synthStyle fill:#f5f5f5,stroke:#666666,stroke-width:2px
    classDef externalStyle fill:#ffffff,stroke:#999999,stroke-width:2px,dasharray: 5 5
    classDef planningCoachStyle fill:#b3e5fc,stroke:#0984e3,stroke-width:2px
    classDef techniqueCoachStyle fill:#c8e6c9,stroke:#27ae60,stroke-width:2px
    classDef recoveryCoachStyle fill:#ffccbc,stroke:#e67e22,stroke-width:2px

    class Input inputStyle
    class Router routerStyle
    class Workflow workflowStyle
    class Planner planningStyle
    class Synthesizer synthStyle
    class LLM,RAG,Memory externalStyle
    class Planning planningCoachStyle
    class Technique techniqueCoachStyle
    class Recovery recoveryCoachStyle

    %% 执行顺序说明
    note1[执行顺序:
    1. 问题分类
    2. 知识检索
    3. 训练规划(第一批)
    4. 技术+康复(第二批并行)
    5. 综合整合]

    note1 -.-> Workflow
